      "lines": [
        "的罐子能装下 12 公斤煤油吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "251",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式 $y=-1.8x$ 给出一个正比例函数。$x$ 的值等于 $-15$",
        "时，对应的函数值是什么？当 $x$ 取什么值时，函数值等",
        "于 72？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "252",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在数轴上表示不等式的解集合：",
        "а) $|x|\\leqslant7$；　　　　　　　б) $|x|\\geqslant3$。",
        "把解集合写成数区间或者数区间的并集的形式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "14．把一个数分成和几个已知数成",
        "比例的几部分"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设数 $a,b,c$ 有下列性质：$\\frac{a}{2}=k,\\frac{b}{5}=k,\\frac{c}{7}=k$，即 $a=2k$，",
        "$b=5k,c=7k$，其中 $k$ 是不等于零的数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这种情况通常说成：数 $a,b,c$ 和数 $2,5,7$ 成正比",
        "（$k$ 是比例系数）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来解下面的应用题："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知三角形三边的长和 $2,3,4$ 成正比，周长等于 45 cm，",
        "求边长。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解：设 $k$ 是比例系数，那么三角形三边的长等于 $2k$ cm，",
        "$3k$ cm，$4k$ cm。由于三角形周长等于 45 cm，列出方程：",
        "$2k+3k+4k=45$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程，得到 $k=5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，$2k=10,3k=15,4k=20$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "三角形三边的长是：10 cm，15 cm，20 cm。（注意，由"
      ]
    },
